---
import Layout from '@/components/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About — Sayan" description="About Sayan: a student who builds websites, apps, Python tools, Linux experiments, and random useful things." active="about">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div>
          <h1>About me</h1>
          <p>
            Hi — I'm Sayan. I'm a student and a builder. I make websites, apps, experiments,
            Python tools, Linux setups, and small hardware projects whenever an idea feels
            worth trying.
          </p>
          <p>
            This website is my personal corner of the internet — not a company, not a
            startup, not a social network. Its main job is to be the one URL I remember so
            I can reach every project I've built without digging through browser history or
            old hosting dashboards.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="focus-card">
          <div class="label">Current focus</div>
          <p style="margin:0; color:var(--color-text-muted);">
            Currently focused on Class 10 studies while continuing to build projects
            whenever I get an idea worth trying.
          </p>
          <p style="margin-top:1rem; font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--color-text-dim);">
            This is editable content — I update it as my focus changes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 style="margin-top:3rem;">What I like building</h2>
      <div class="about-grid" style="margin-top:1rem;">
        <div>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <li><strong>Development</strong></li>
            <li>Android apps</li>
            <li>Websites</li>
            <li>Python tools</li>
            <li>Automation</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <li><strong>Linux &amp; systems</strong></li>
            <li>Linux experiments</li>
            <li>Dotfiles &amp; config</li>
            <li>Terminal workflows</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <li><strong>Creative</strong></li>
            <li>Video</li>
            <li>Photography</li>
            <li>Editing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <li><strong>Hardware</strong></li>
            <li>Arduino</li>
            <li>Electronics</li>
            <li>Experiments</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <li><strong>AI</strong></li>
            <li>AI experiments</li>
            <li>Computer vision</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <li><strong>Study tools</strong></li>
            <li>Student-focused utilities</li>
            <li>Revision trackers</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top:2.5rem; color:var(--color-text-muted); font-size:0.9rem;">
        No percentage ratings here — those are meaningless. These are just the things I
        enjoy building, listed plainly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
